THIS IS A REDUCED BUILD OF LAME 4.0
===================================

This tree is LAME 4.0 (release tarball of the SVN tag RELEASE__4_0, r6552),
reduced to what the ThinkMeta.ConcurrentTasks MP3 sample needs:

  - MPEG-1 Layer III encoding with the "new" VBR routine (vbr_mtrh) only,
    default -V 4; no CBR, ABR, old VBR routine or free format
  - WAV file input only (PCM 8/16/24/32 bit, 32 bit float), 32, 44.1 or
    48 kHz; no resampling, no MPEG-2/2.5, no stdin/stdout
  - no decoder, gapless (nogap) encoding, ID3 tags, ReplayGain or frame
    analyzer
  - x64 only, built with MSBuild (libmp3lame/libmp3lame.vcxproj,
    frontend/lame.vcxproj); the autotools build and the side projects
    (ACM, DirectShow, DLL, mp3x, mp3rtp) are removed

For the same options and a supported input, the output is bit-identical to
the unmodified LAME 4.0 - except that the output keeps the input sample
rate where LAME would have lowered it (-V 6.5 and above at 44.1/48 kHz,
-V 8 and above at 32 kHz); there it is bit-identical to LAME 4.0 with
--resample <input rate>.

The original text of this file follows.

